        {
          "textRaw": "[m] utterance",
          "name": "[m]_utterance",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "utterance(text, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "utterance",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Async</code></strong> <strong><code>Overload [1-2]/2</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>text</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 待朗读文本</li>\n<li><strong>[ options = <code>{}</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"#ttsoptions\">TtsOptions</a> } - 朗读选项</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#ttsutterance\">TtsUtterance</a> } - 可监听的朗读任务</li>\n</ul>\n<p>创建可监听事件和主动停止的朗读任务.</p>\n<p><code>utterance</code> 也可写作 <code>speakTask</code>.</p>\n<p>任务的 <code>result</code> 属性是与 <a href=\"#m-speak\">speak</a> 返回值等价的 Promise.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let task = tts.utterance(&#39;This task can be observed&#39;);\n\ntask\n    .on(&#39;start&#39;, (info) =&gt; {\n        console.log(info.id);\n    })\n    .on(&#39;done&#39;, (result) =&gt; {\n        console.log(result.duration);\n    });\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
