              "textRaw": "voices(filter?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "voices",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Async</code></strong> <strong><code>Overload [1-2]/2</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>[ filter = <code>{}</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"#ttsvoicefilter\">TtsVoiceFilter</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 引擎名称或语音过滤条件</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise\">Promise</a> } - 兑现值为 <a href=\"#ttsvoiceinfo\">TtsVoiceInfo</a> 数组</li>\n</ul>\n<p>返回指定引擎的语音列表.</p>\n<p>字符串参数视为引擎名称.<br>\n对象参数可按引擎, 区域, 离线能力和安装状态过滤.</p>\n",
