          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "isLanguageAvailable(locale, engineOrOptions?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "isLanguageAvailable",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Async</code></strong> <strong><code>Overload [1-2]/2</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>locale</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - IETF 语言标签</li>\n<li><strong>[ engineOrOptions ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"#ttsenginequeryoptions\">TtsEngineQueryOptions</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 引擎名称或查询选项</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise\">Promise</a> } - 兑现值为 <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> 类型的可用状态</li>\n</ul>\n<p>检查指定引擎是否支持语言.</p>\n<p>区域标签中的 <code>_</code> 会转换为 <code>-</code>.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
