          "textRaw": "[m] installData",
          "name": "[m]_installdata",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "installData(engineOrOptions?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "installData",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Overload [1-2]/2</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>[ engineOrOptions ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"#ttsenginequeryoptions\">TtsEngineQueryOptions</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 引擎名称或查询选项</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否成功打开语音数据安装界面</li>\n</ul>\n<p>尝试打开指定引擎的语音数据安装界面.</p>\n<p>设备没有可处理该 Intent 的界面, 或启动失败时返回 <code>false</code>.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
