        },
        {
          "textRaw": "选项",
          "name": "选项",
          "modules": [
            {
              "textRaw": "TtsOptions",
              "name": "ttsoptions",
              "desc": "<p>每次调用中未指定的选项继承 <a href=\"#m-defaults\">defaults</a> 的当前值. 初始默认值如下:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>[ engine = <code>null</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 引擎包名, <code>null</code> 表示系统默认引擎</li>\n<li><strong>[ locale = <code>null</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - IETF 语言标签</li>\n<li><strong>[ voice = <code>null</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 语音名称</li>\n<li><strong>[ rate = <code>1</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 语速, 范围为 <code>0.1..4</code></li>\n<li><strong>[ pitch = <code>1</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 音高, 范围为 <code>0.1..4</code></li>\n<li><strong>[ volume = <code>1</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 音量, 范围为 <code>0..1</code></li>\n<li><strong>[ pan = <code>0</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 左右声道位置, 范围为 <code>-1..1</code></li>\n<li><strong>[ queue = <code>&#39;flush&#39;</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 队列模式</li>\n<li><strong>[ autoSplit = <code>true</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否自动拆分长文本</li>\n<li><strong>[ offlineOnly = <code>false</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否仅选择离线语音</li>\n<li><strong>[ audioEvents = <code>false</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否接收音频数据事件</li>\n<li><strong>[ usage = <code>&#39;media&#39;</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - Android 音频用途</li>\n<li><strong>[ timeout = <code>&#39;auto&#39;</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> | <code>&#39;auto&#39;</code> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 任务超时, 单位为毫秒</li>\n<li><strong>[ parameters = <code>{}</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">Object</a> } - 传给文本转语音引擎的额外参数</li>\n</ul>\n<p>兼容属性名称:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>locale</code>: <code>language</code>, <code>lang</code>.</li>\n<li><code>rate</code>: <code>speechRate</code>.</li>\n<li><code>autoSplit</code>: <code>split</code>.</li>\n<li><code>offlineOnly</code>: <code>offline</code>.</li>\n<li><code>audioEvents</code>: <code>emitAudio</code>.</li>\n<li><code>usage</code>: <code>audioUsage</code>.</li>\n<li><code>timeout</code>: <code>timeoutMillis</code>, <code>timeoutMs</code>.</li>\n<li><code>parameters</code>: <code>params</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>locale</code> 和 <code>voice</code> 不能在同一组选项中同时指定为非 <code>null</code>.<br>\n队列模式可使用 <code>flush</code>, <code>replace</code>, <code>add</code>, <code>enqueue</code>, <code>append</code>, <code>0</code> 或 <code>1</code>.<br>\n音频用途支持 <code>media</code>, <code>accessibility</code>, <code>assistant</code>, <code>navigation</code>, <code>alarm</code>, <code>notification</code> 和 <code>voiceCommunication</code>.</p>\n<p><code>timeout</code> 为 <code>0</code> 时禁用任务超时.<br>\n<code>timeout</code> 为 <code>null</code> 或 <code>auto</code> 时根据操作类型和文本长度自动计算.<br>\n其他超时值必须是 <code>1000..86400000</code> 范围内的整数.</p>\n<p><code>parameters</code> 最多包含 32 项. 属性值只能是字符串, 布尔值或有限数值. <code>rate</code>, <code>engine</code>, <code>pitch</code>, <code>volume</code>, <code>pan</code> 和 <code>utteranceId</code> 等已有专用选项的名称不能重复用于 <code>parameters</code>.</p>\n<p>未知选项会使调用抛出异常.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "TtsOptions"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "TtsFileOptions",
              "name": "ttsfileoptions",
              "desc": "<p>TtsFileOptions 包含全部 <a href=\"#ttsoptions\">TtsOptions</a>, 并增加:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>[ overwrite = <code>true</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否替换已存在的目标文件</li>\n<li><strong>[ createDirectories = <code>true</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否创建缺失的父目录</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>mkdirs</code> 可作为 <code>createDirectories</code> 的别名.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "TtsFileOptions"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "TtsEngineQueryOptions",
              "name": "TtsEngineQueryOptions",
              "desc": "<ul>\n<li><strong>[ engine ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 引擎包名</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "TtsVoiceFilter"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "TtsVoiceFilter",
              "name": "ttsvoicefilter",
              "desc": "<ul>\n<li><strong>[ engine ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 引擎包名</li>\n<li><strong>[ locale ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - IETF 语言标签</li>\n<li><strong>[ offlineOnly = <code>false</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否仅返回离线语音</li>\n<li><strong>[ installedOnly = <code>false</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否仅返回已安装语音</li>\n</ul>\n<p>兼容属性名称:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>locale</code>: <code>language</code>, <code>lang</code>.</li>\n<li><code>offlineOnly</code>: <code>offline</code>.</li>\n<li><code>installedOnly</code>: <code>installed</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "TtsVoiceFilter"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "选项"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "返回对象",
          "name": "返回对象",
          "modules": [
            {
              "textRaw": "TtsStatus",
              "name": "TtsStatus",
              "desc": "<ul>\n<li><strong>state</strong> { <code>&#39;idle&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;initializing&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;working&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;ready&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;failed&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;closed&#39;</code> } - 服务状态</li>\n<li><strong>engine</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 最近实际使用的引擎</li>\n<li><strong>requestedEngine</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 当前请求的引擎</li>\n<li><strong>activeId</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 活动任务 ID</li>\n<li><strong>operation</strong> { <code>&#39;speech&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;silence&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;file&#39;</code> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 活动操作类型</li>\n<li><strong>queued</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 等待任务数量</li>\n<li><strong>isSpeaking</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否正在朗读</li>\n<li><strong>isBusy</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否存在活动任务</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "TtsDefaults"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "TtsDefaults",
              "name": "ttsdefaults",
              "desc": "<ul>\n<li><strong>engine</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 默认引擎包名</li>\n<li><strong>locale</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 默认语言标签</li>\n<li><strong>voice</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 默认语音名称</li>\n<li><strong>rate</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 默认语速</li>\n<li><strong>pitch</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 默认音高</li>\n<li><strong>volume</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 默认音量</li>\n<li><strong>pan</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 默认声道位置</li>\n<li><strong>queue</strong> { <code>&#39;flush&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;add&#39;</code> } - 默认队列模式</li>\n<li><strong>autoSplit</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否自动拆分文本</li>\n<li><strong>offlineOnly</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否仅使用离线语音</li>\n<li><strong>audioEvents</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否接收音频事件</li>\n<li><strong>usage</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 默认音频用途</li>\n<li><strong>timeout</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> | <code>&#39;auto&#39;</code> } - 默认超时</li>\n<li><strong>parameters</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">Object</a> } - 默认引擎参数</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "TtsDefaults"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "返回对象"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "TtsUtterance",
          "name": "ttsutterance",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>extends</strong></ins> { <a href=\"eventEmitterType\">EventEmitter</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>TtsUtterance 表示一个可监听和停止的文本转语音任务. 它不能由脚本直接构造.</p>\n<p>它继承 <a href=\"eventEmitterType\">EventEmitter</a> 的 <code>addListener</code>, <code>eventNames</code>, <code>listenerCount</code>, <code>listeners</code>, <code>prependListener</code>, <code>prependOnceListener</code>, <code>removeAllListeners</code>, <code>removeListener</code> 和 <code>setMaxListeners</code> 等方法.</p>\n",
          "modules": [
            {
              "textRaw": "[p#] TtsUtterance#id",
              "name": "[p#]_ttsutterance#id",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>READONLY</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>任务 ID.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[p#] TtsUtterance#id"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[p#] TtsUtterance#operation",
              "name": "[p#]_ttsutterance#operation",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>READONLY</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>{ <code>&#39;speech&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;silence&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;file&#39;</code> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>任务操作类型.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[p#] TtsUtterance#operation"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[p#] TtsUtterance#text",
              "name": "[p#]_ttsutterance#text",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>READONLY</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>任务输入文本. 静音任务为 <code>null</code>.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[p#] TtsUtterance#text"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[p#] TtsUtterance#result",
              "name": "[p#]_ttsutterance#result",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>READONLY</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise\">Promise</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>任务结果 Promise, 兑现值为 <a href=\"#ttsresult\">TtsResult</a>.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[p#] TtsUtterance#result"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[p#] TtsUtterance#state",
              "name": "[p#]_ttsutterance#state",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>READONLY</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>{ <code>&#39;created&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;queued&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;running&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;done&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;stopped&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;error&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;cancelled&#39;</code> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>任务当前状态.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[p#] TtsUtterance#state"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[p#] TtsUtterance#isDone",
              "name": "[p#]_ttsutterance#isdone",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>READONLY</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>任务是否已经进入终止状态.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[p#] TtsUtterance#isDone"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] TtsUtterance#on(eventName, listener)",
              "name": "[m#]_ttsutterance#on(eventname,_listener)",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>eventName</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 事件名称</li>\n<li><strong>listener</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#function\">Function</a> } - 事件监听器</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#ttsutterance\">TtsUtterance</a> } - 当前任务</li>\n</ul>\n<p>注册持续事件监听器.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] TtsUtterance#on(eventName, listener)"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] TtsUtterance#once(eventName, listener)",
              "name": "[m#]_ttsutterance#once(eventname,_listener)",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>eventName</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 事件名称</li>\n<li><strong>listener</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#function\">Function</a> } - 单次事件监听器</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#ttsutterance\">TtsUtterance</a> } - 当前任务</li>\n</ul>\n<p>注册仅执行一次的事件监听器.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] TtsUtterance#once(eventName, listener)"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] TtsUtterance#stop()",
              "name": "[m#]_ttsutterance#stop()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#ttsutterance\">TtsUtterance</a> } - 当前任务</li>\n</ul>\n<p>请求停止此任务.</p>\n<p>已结束或已经请求停止时不重复提交停止命令.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] TtsUtterance#stop()"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "[m#] TtsUtterance#cancel()",
              "name": "[m#]_ttsutterance#cancel()",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#ttsutterance\">TtsUtterance</a> } - 当前任务</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>TtsUtterance#stop()</code> 的别名.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "[m#] TtsUtterance#cancel()"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "TtsUtterance"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "TtsUtterance 事件",
          "name": "ttsutterance_事件",
          "desc": "<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>监听器参数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>queued</code></td>\n<td><code>info</code> { <a href=\"#ttsqueuedevent\">TtsQueuedEvent</a> }</td>\n<td>任务已进入服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>start</code></td>\n<td><code>info</code> { <a href=\"#ttsstartevent\">TtsStartEvent</a> }</td>\n<td>任务开始执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>chunk</code></td>\n<td><code>info</code> { <a href=\"#ttschunkevent\">TtsChunkEvent</a> }</td>\n<td>开始朗读一个文本块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>range</code></td>\n<td><code>info</code> { <a href=\"#ttsrangeevent\">TtsRangeEvent</a> }</td>\n<td>引擎报告当前文本范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>synthesis</code></td>\n<td><code>info</code> { <a href=\"#ttssynthesisevent\">TtsSynthesisEvent</a> }</td>\n<td>引擎报告音频格式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>audio</code></td>\n<td><code>info</code> { <a href=\"#ttsaudioevent\">TtsAudioEvent</a> }</td>\n<td>引擎提供音频数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>done</code></td>\n<td><code>result</code> { <a href=\"#ttsresult\">TtsResult</a> }</td>\n<td>任务正常完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>stop</code></td>\n<td><code>info</code> { <a href=\"#ttsstopevent\">TtsStopEvent</a> }</td>\n<td>任务停止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>error</code></td>\n<td><code>error</code> { <a href=\"#ttserror\">TtsError</a> }</td>\n<td>任务失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cancelled</code></td>\n<td><code>info</code> { <a href=\"#ttsstopevent\">TtsStopEvent</a> }</td>\n<td>任务被取消</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>调用任务的 <code>stop</code> 或 <code>cancel</code> 后, 会依次触发 <code>stop</code> 和 <code>cancelled</code>.<br>\n由队列替换导致的平台停止会触发 <code>stop</code>, 但不会触发 <code>cancelled</code>.</p>\n<p>只有 <code>audioEvents</code> 为 <code>true</code> 时才接收 <code>audio</code> 事件.</p>\n",
          "modules": [
            {
              "textRaw": "TtsAudioEvent",
              "name": "TtsAudioEvent",
              "desc": "<ul>\n<li><strong>id</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 任务 ID</li>\n<li><strong>data</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#bytearray\">ByteArray</a> } - 音频字节数组</li>\n<li><strong>chunk</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 当前块序号</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "TtsStopEvent"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "TtsStopEvent",
              "name": "ttsstopevent",
              "desc": "<ul>\n<li><strong>id</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 任务 ID</li>\n<li><strong>operation</strong> { <code>&#39;speech&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;silence&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;file&#39;</code> } - 操作类型</li>\n<li><strong>status</strong> { <code>&#39;stopped&#39;</code> } - 停止状态</li>\n<li><strong>reason</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 停止原因</li>\n</ul>\n<p>常见停止原因为 <code>cancelled</code>, <code>flushed</code>, <code>interrupted</code>, <code>stopped</code> 或 <code>reset</code>.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "TtsStopEvent"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "TtsError",
              "name": "ttserror",
              "desc": "<ul>\n<li><strong>code</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - TTS 错误代码</li>\n<li><strong>message</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 错误消息</li>\n<li><strong>errorCode</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - Android 文本转语音错误码</li>\n<li><strong>reason</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#undefined\">undefined</a> } - 中断原因</li>\n</ul>\n<p>只有中断错误包含 <code>reason</code>.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "TtsError"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "TtsUtterance 事件"
        }
      ],
      "type": "module",
      "displayName": "文本转语音 (TTS)"
    }
  ]
}